    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>10级 头目 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 104；''重伤'' 52</span><span>''先攻'' +10</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 26，''强韧'' 22，''反射'' 22，''意志'' 22</span><span>''侦查'' +12</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 7</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">恶犬夹击</div>\n<div class=description>人类海盗船长对被其夹击的敌人的攻击骰获得+1 加值，且其攻击对该生物造成 2d6 额外伤<br>害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}海盗短弯刀（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+16 vs. AC<br>命中：2d6+6 伤害，且目标迟缓（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/close}}恶毒嘲弄✦充能 6{{$:/dnd/images/six}}</div>\n<div class=description>近程爆发 5；以一个敌人为目标；目标触发每一个邻接它的敌人的借机攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">绳上猴子✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>该人类海盗船长获得攀爬速度 7 直到其下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/close}}武装召唤✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当首次重伤时。<br>近程爆发 10；以盟友为目标；目标以一个自由动作进行一次近战基本攻击或快步 3 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+13，运动+13</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 16（+8）</span><span>''敏捷'' 16（+8）</span><span>''感知'' 14（+7）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 16（+8）</span><span>''智力'' 13（+6）</span><span>''魅力'' 16（+8）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 海盗短弯刀（短剑）</span></div></div>\n</div>",
